#. TRANSLATORS: Multi-file help; keep + file1 file2 ..., [Settings2] MultiFileArg=1, - and -- literal.
#: src/app/main.cpp
msgid ""
"+ file1 file2 ...  Open up to 32 files (additional paths are ignored).\n"
"[Settings2] MultiFileArg=1 uses this mode by default; - or -- forces one path.\n"
"Multiple files always open in separate new windows; preceding options apply to every file."
msgstr ""
"+ file1 file2 ...  開啟最多 32 個檔案（忽略超出數量的路徑）。\n"
"[Settings2] MultiFileArg=1 預設使用此模式；- 或 -- 強制將後續參數視為單一路徑。\n"
"多個檔案一律分別在新視窗中開啟；檔案清單前的選項套用至每個檔案。"

#. TRANSLATORS: New wxnotepad help for original LoadFlags; keep -n, -ns, -r and -rs unchanged.
#: src/app/main.cpp
msgid ""
"-n  Always open a new window.\n"
"-ns  Match an existing window only for the same file.\n"
"-r  Reuse an available window.\n"
"-rs  Reuse without a file; otherwise match only the same file."
msgstr ""
"-n  始終開啟新視窗。\n"
"-ns  僅當開啟相同檔案時使用現有視窗。\n"
"-r  重用可用視窗。\n"
"-rs  無檔案時重用視窗；否則僅比對相同檔案。"

